---
description: Spec-driven docs workflow for MFE interview repo
globs:
  - apps/docs/**/*
---

When working in `apps/docs`:

1. Read `apps/docs/AGENTS.md`
2. Read `apps/docs/progress-tracker.md`
3. Read the relevant feature spec from `apps/docs/feature-specs/`

Default to **planning mode** — no application code unless the user asks to implement.

After meaningful doc work:

- Update `apps/docs/progress-tracker.md`
- Update `apps/docs/feature-specs/00-index.md` if spec status changed
